InitialConnection: `8`
ClientReason: `VersionMismatch`
ProtocolConstant: `VERSION_MISMATCH`

This error appears when a version mismatch occurs. Please ensure you are running the latest version of Geyser and the latest stable release of Minecraft Bedrock Edition. Geyser does not support preview versions. For a list of currently supported versions, please refer to the [Geyser Wiki](https://geysermc.org/wiki/geyser/supported-versions).

To download the latest build of Geyser, run `/download geyser` in <#613194762249437245>.